{"seq":3,"slug":"next-gen-batteries","title":"下一代电池","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/next-gen-batteries","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solid-state-batteries","title":"固态电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/next-gen-batteries/solid-state-batteries","wordCount":2020,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"sodium-ion-batteries","title":"钠离子电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/next-gen-batteries/sodium-ion-batteries","wordCount":2110,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"lithium-sulfur-air","title":"锂硫与锂空气电池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/next-gen-batteries/lithium-sulfur-air","wordCount":2055,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"下一代电池\">下一代电池</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>锂离子电池正逼近其材料体系的理论极限。本章覆盖三大前沿方向：固态电池（解决安全与能量密度瓶颈）、钠离子电池（解决资源约束与成本问题）、以及锂硫/锂空气等超高能量密度体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>固态电池</td>\n<td>固态电解质类型（氧化物/硫化物/聚合物）、界面问题、量产挑战与时间线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>钠离子电池</td>\n<td>层状氧化物/普鲁士蓝/聚阴离子正极、硬碳负极、成本优势与适用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>锂硫与锂空气电池</td>\n<td>理论能量密度、穿梭效应、催化剂设计、商业化距离评估</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>固态电解质</strong>：替代液态电解液的无机/有机固体离子导体，消除漏液与燃烧风险</li>\n<li><strong>穿梭效应（Shuttle Effect）</strong>：锂硫电池中多硫化物在正负极间往返导致容量衰减</li>\n<li><strong>硬碳（Hard Carbon）</strong>：钠离子电池首选负极材料，源自生物质热解</li>\n</ul>\n"}